        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Laws: Job Training Partnership Act of 1982\n- People: Ronald Reagan, Bonnie Newman, Judd Gregg, George H. W. Bush\n- Organizations: United States Department of Labor\n- Roles: President of the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The Job Training Partnership Act of 1982 was a United States federal law passed on October 13, 1982.\n- The United States Department of Labor passed the Job Training Partnership Act of 1982 during the Ronald Reagan administration.\n- Ronald Reagan served as the 40th President of the United States from 1981 to 1989.\n- Ronald Reagan was an American statesman and actor.\n- Bonnie Newman is a Republican.\n- Bonnie Newman worked for Judd Gregg, Ronald Reagan, and George H. W. Bush.",
